Welcome to Lacunosa Town.{VAR BE01}
In this town, people live as methodically
as clockwork from morning to night.{VAR BE01}
If you live your life soaking up sunlight,
you can sleep very well at night.

Well, hello there, young traveler!{VAR BE01}
Would you like to hear an old story
of Lacunosa Town?{VAR BE01}
Bear with me, because I'm an old lady who
likes telling tales the old-fashioned way!

There's a great big hole at the back
of this town.{VAR BE01}
A long time ago, a huge meteor fell from
the sky and made the big hole.{VAR BE01}
A very scary monster was hiding
inside the meteor!{VAR BE01}
People say the monster appeared in the
village at night, bringing a cold wind, and{VAR BE00}
it stole away people and Pokémon...{VAR BE01}
So the villagers built big walls to keep
the monster out and made a rule that{VAR BE00}
no one could go out after dark.{VAR BE01}

...Of course, nowadays nobody believes in
such things.{VAR BE01}
But you know...{VAR BE01}
Even now, the people of this town
stay inside after dark.{VAR BE00}
Isn't that strange?{VAR BE01}
I guess old stories and old traditions
have some influence on our current life.

At night, a scary monster comes out of
the big hole, so you have to go home{VAR BE00}
and be good!

Along the road ahead, there is a
coastline that fishing fans love.{VAR BE01}
Whirrrrr...plunk!{VAR BE01}
That's the sound my fishing rod makes.
I like to hear it every day!

My grandma loves to tell old stories.{VAR BE01}
She makes me listen to her long stories
all the time!

There are a lot of people in the world,
and there are just as many different{VAR BE00}
characteristics and ideas.
